      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's understandable that you feel trapped in a never-ending cycle, but remember, it's not just about you. Your presence, even if it feels insignificant, can make a difference. You are part of a larger system, and every small action counts. It's okay to feel overwhelmed, but don't let it consume you. You have the strength to endure, even if it feels like you're just going through the motions. Keep going, even when it feels pointless.",
      "source": "target",
