    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"keep going\" is the part that's hardest. everyone always says that. but what if \"going on\" is just more of the same misery? i look at these people i'm treating, and i just see a cycle of pain that never ends. i'm just so tired. i don't want to be strong anymore. i just want the noise to stop. i want everything to just... be quiet.",
